# Calibrated nozzle aim-point calculation service.  SprayTask calls it after a
# disease target is selected and before AlignTarget.  The server returns the
# target pixel for a fixed positive working plane; it performs no arm movement,
# visual-servo command or relay operation, so callers retain execution control.
# Request: working-plane distance from the configured calibration, in metres.
float32 working_range_m                # Must be finite and strictly positive; 0 is invalid here.
---
# Response: desired full-image nozzle-axis pixel and the image dimensions used
# to validate it.  success=false prevents normal visual-servo entry.
bool success                           # True when calibration/range resolution succeeded.
float32 desired_u_px                   # Horizontal target pixel in the returned image frame.
float32 desired_v_px                   # Vertical target pixel in the returned image frame.
uint32 image_width                     # Image width that bounds desired_u_px.
uint32 image_height                    # Image height that bounds desired_v_px.
string message                         # Human-readable calibration/validation detail.
